config BOARD_FATCATRVP_NPCX
	bool "Google Fatcat Nuvoton (npcx9m7f) add-in card for the RVP"
	help
	  Build Google Nuvoton npcx9m7f based Fatcat add-in card.
	  This board is for use with the Intel RVP using the
	  MECC 2.1 connector.

